<title>FRANCE: France to hold wheat food aid tender April 8 -ONIC.</title>
<headline>France to hold wheat food aid tender April 8 -ONIC.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>France will hold a food aid tender on April 8 for the supply of 3,000 tonnes of soft wheat to Mauritania, national grain office ONIC said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The wheat is for shipment in bags between April 22 and May 9, it said.</p>
<p>--Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
